cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use P-Nav in academic work, please cite the accompanying paper and/or this repository."
title: "P-Nav: A Multi-Mode Real-Time Positioning and Quality-Monitoring Platform for Android Smartphones"
abstract: "P-Nav is an open-source Android platform for smartphone GNSS data acquisition, multi-mode real-time positioning (SPP, DGNSS, RTK), and on-device observation quality monitoring."
type: software
license: BSD-2-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/TODO/P-Nav"
keywords:
  - GNSS
  - Android
  - raw measurements
  - real-time kinematic
  - RTK
  - quality monitoring
  - RINEX
  - smartphone positioning
authors:
